OL,3,GNEWSA'Courageous' RNLI crew save person
OL,4,Ain sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA person was rescued from the sea off
OL,7,FBlackpool's South Promenade after
OL,8,Fgetting into difficulty near the
OL,9,FSandcastle.
OL,11,FBlackpool RNLI volunteers launched
OL,12,Ftheir lifeboat in rough conditions with
OL,13,F"crashing waves" at about 13:50 BST on
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FThe casualty was pulled from the water
OL,17,Fas they were being swept towards South
OL,18,FPier before being taken to Blackpool
OL,19,FVictoria Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
